---
description: Superpowers agentic workflow — consult vendored skills before creative work, debugging, or finishing.
alwaysApply: true
---

This project vendors the **Superpowers** skill library (by obra / Prime Radiant) in
`.cursor/skills/`. Treat these as mandatory process skills, not suggestions.

Before acting, check whether a skill applies and follow it:

- **Building a feature / new behavior** → read `.cursor/skills/brainstorming/SKILL.md` first,
  then `.cursor/skills/writing-plans/SKILL.md` before writing code.
- **Fixing a bug / unexpected behavior** → read `.cursor/skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md`.
- **Writing code** → follow `.cursor/skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md`
  (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR). Tests run with `npm test` (Vitest).
- **Before saying "done"** → `.cursor/skills/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md`.
- **Wrapping up a branch** → `.cursor/skills/finishing-a-development-branch/SKILL.md`.

When a skill applies, announce "Using [skill] to [purpose]" and follow it exactly.
Direct user instructions always take precedence over skills.
